    <item>
      <title>New Website!</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/blog/intro/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/blog/intro/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I &lt;em&gt;finally&lt;/em&gt; made a website! I&amp;rsquo;ll be on the job market soon, so I&amp;rsquo;m glad to finally be able to present my research and become more visible within the field.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;All of my &#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/project/&#34;&gt;research&lt;/a&gt; is posted, including all of my first research experiences (summer REUs, undergraduate experiences, etc). The wording is all from posters/papers that I made at the time (since 2019!), so you can clearly see how my &amp;ldquo;scientific prose&amp;rdquo; has developed over the years.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
